{"seq":2,"slug":"membranes-and-transport","title":"生物膜与膜运输","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/cell-fundamentals/membranes-and-transport","wordCount":1679,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"生物膜与膜运输\">生物膜与膜运输</h1><p>一层厚度仅约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\ nm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">nm</span></span></span></span></span> 的膜，把生命与非生命分隔开来。它薄到要用纳米计量，却能精确决定哪些分子进、哪些分子出、以什么速率、消耗多少能量。这层膜不是被动的塑料袋，而是细胞与世界谈判的前线。本篇讲清楚膜的结构为何如此设计，以及物质穿越它的全部方式——这是理解能量转换与信号接收的物理基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>生物膜的主体是磷脂双分子层。磷脂分子一端是亲水的磷酸头部，两端是疏水的脂肪酸尾部；在水环境中，它们自发排成两层，尾部相对藏于内、头部朝向两侧水相，形成既封闭又稳定的屏障。这种「亲水头朝外、疏水尾朝内」的两亲性自组装，是膜结构的物理根源。</p>\n<p>1972 年辛格与尼科尔森提出的流动镶嵌模型，至今是描述膜结构的标准框架：磷脂双层像二维流体，蛋白质如冰山般镶嵌或漂浮其中，可侧向扩散。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[两亲性磷脂] --&gt; B[自发形成双分子层]&#10;  B --&gt; C[流动镶嵌模型&lt;br/&gt;1972]&#10;  C --&gt; D[整合膜蛋白&lt;br/&gt;通道/载体/泵]&#10;  C --&gt; E[外周膜蛋白]&#10;  C --&gt; F[胆固醇调节流动性]&#10;  D --&gt; G{物质如何跨膜}&#10;  G --&gt;|顺梯度不耗能| H[被动运输]&#10;  G --&gt;|逆梯度耗ATP| I[主动运输]&#10;  G --&gt;|膜泡| J[胞吞/胞吐]\">graph TD\n  A[两亲性磷脂] --&gt; B[自发形成双分子层]\n  B --&gt; C[流动镶嵌模型&lt;br/&gt;1972]\n  C --&gt; D[整合膜蛋白&lt;br/&gt;通道/载体/泵]\n  C --&gt; E[外周膜蛋白]\n  C --&gt; F[胆固醇调节流动性]\n  D --&gt; G{物质如何跨膜}\n  G --&gt;|顺梯度不耗能| H[被动运输]\n  G --&gt;|逆梯度耗ATP| I[主动运输]\n  G --&gt;|膜泡| J[胞吞/胞吐]</pre><p>膜运输按是否消耗能量、是否需要蛋白介导，可作如下区分。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运输方式</th>\n<th>是否耗能</th>\n<th>是否需载体</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>典型例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单扩散</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>顺浓度梯度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、小脂溶性分子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协助扩散</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（通道/载体）</td>\n<td>顺浓度梯度</td>\n<td>葡萄糖经 GLUT、水经水通道蛋白</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渗透</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>水通道蛋白可加速</td>\n<td>水顺渗透梯度</td>\n<td>红细胞在低渗液中胀破</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主动运输</td>\n<td>是（ATP 或梯度）</td>\n<td>是（泵）</td>\n<td>逆浓度梯度</td>\n<td>钠钾泵、质子泵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>胞吞/胞吐</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>膜泡机制</td>\n<td>大分子/颗粒</td>\n<td>吞噬、神经递质释放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"膜的流动性与不对称性\">膜的流动性与不对称性</h2><p>膜不是僵硬的板，而是有「黏度」的流体。流动性受脂肪酸链的饱和度与长度、温度、以及胆固醇含量调节。不饱和脂肪酸的双键使链弯折、堆积松散，提高流动性；胆固醇则是「流动性缓冲剂」——高温时它限制磷脂运动、降低流动性，低温时它阻止磷脂规则堆积、防止膜冻结僵化。</p>\n<p>膜还是高度不对称的。双层的两个小叶脂质组成不同，膜蛋白与糖链有固定取向：糖基化的糖蛋白与糖脂只朝向细胞外侧，构成细胞表面的「糖被」，参与细胞识别。这种不对称由内膜系统在合成时就建立——蛋白质在内质网腔面糖基化的部分，最终注定朝向细胞外，相关分选机制见 <a href=\"organelles-endomembrane-system\">细胞器与内膜系统</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"被动运输-顺势而下\">被动运输：顺势而下</h2><p>被动运输不消耗细胞能量，其驱动力来自分子自身的浓度梯度（对带电粒子还要叠加电位梯度，合称电化学梯度）。脂溶性小分子如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可直接溶解穿过双层，这是简单扩散。极性分子与离子无法穿过疏水核心，需借蛋白质：通道蛋白形成亲水孔道，让特定离子或水快速通过；载体蛋白则结合底物、构象变化、再释放，速率较慢但更具选择性。</p>\n<p>扩散通量遵循菲克定律，净通量正比于浓度差：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mtext> </mtext><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J = -D\\,\\dfrac{dC}{dx}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为扩散系数。当膜两侧浓度相等时净通量为零，体系达到平衡——但这只是「无净移动」，分子仍在双向穿梭。</p>\n<p>水的跨膜移动（渗透）尤其重要。水分子虽小且极性，自由穿膜很慢，红细胞、肾小管等需快速调水的细胞高表达水通道蛋白（aquaporin）以加速。彼得·阿格雷因发现水通道蛋白获 2003 年诺贝尔化学奖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主动运输-逆势而上\">主动运输：逆势而上</h2><p>许多生理过程要求把物质从低浓度搬向高浓度——这违背自发趋势，必须耗能。能量来源有二：直接水解 ATP 的称初级主动运输，借助另一离子既有梯度的称次级主动运输。</p>\n<p>钠钾泵是初级主动运输的典范：每水解一个 ATP，泵出 3 个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Na^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、泵入 2 个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，维持细胞内高钾低钠的格局。这一格局是神经电信号、细胞体积调节、以及大量次级运输的能量储备。可以说钠钾泵是动物细胞最重要的「电池充电器」之一，约占静息细胞 ATP 消耗的可观比例。</p>\n<p>次级主动运输则「搭便车」：肠上皮细胞的钠-葡萄糖同向转运体（SGLT）利用钠泵建立的钠梯度，把钠顺势内流的能量耦合给葡萄糖逆浓度内吸。这种「梯度即能量货币」的思想，与线粒体用质子梯度合成 ATP 的化学渗透原理同源——详见 <a href=\"../energy-metabolism/mitochondria-respiration\">线粒体与细胞呼吸</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"胞吞与胞吐-大宗物流\">胞吞与胞吐：大宗物流</h2><p>通道与泵只能搬运小分子与离子；蛋白质、多糖、病原体乃至整个细胞这类「大宗货物」，靠膜的变形包裹来运输。胞吞是膜内陷形成膜泡把外物带入：吞噬（吞入大颗粒，如免疫细胞清除细菌）、胞饮（吞入液体与溶质）、以及受体介导的胞吞（受体特异结合配体后聚集内化，如细胞摄取胆固醇载体 LDL）。胞吐则相反，分泌泡与质膜融合，把内容物释放到胞外，如神经递质释放与激素分泌。</p>\n<p>这些膜泡运输与内膜系统的分泌通路无缝衔接——分泌泡正来自高尔基体的加工分选。膜泡如何被精确寻址到目的地、靠什么蛋白质骨架运送，分别见 <a href=\"organelles-endomembrane-system\">细胞器与内膜系统</a> 与 <a href=\"../information-regulation/cytoskeleton-and-motility\">细胞骨架与运动</a>。膜上受体接收信号后触发的胞内反应，则在 <a href=\"../information-regulation/cell-signaling\">细胞信号转导</a> 中展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>生物膜的主体是两亲性磷脂自组装成的双分子层，1972 年流动镶嵌模型至今是其结构标准描述。</li>\n<li>膜流动性由脂肪酸饱和度、温度与胆固醇调节；膜具不对称性，糖链只朝向胞外。</li>\n<li>被动运输（简单扩散、协助扩散、渗透）顺电化学梯度、不耗能，遵循菲克定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J = -D\\,dC/dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>主动运输逆梯度、需耗能：钠钾泵直接水解 ATP，次级运输借既有离子梯度——这一「梯度即货币」思想贯穿能量代谢章。</li>\n<li>胞吞与胞吐处理大分子物流，与内膜系统的分泌通路及细胞骨架运输直接相连。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生物膜与膜运输","id":"生物膜与膜运输"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"膜的流动性与不对称性","id":"膜的流动性与不对称性"},{"level":2,"text":"被动运输：顺势而下","id":"被动运输-顺势而下"},{"level":2,"text":"主动运输：逆势而上","id":"主动运输-逆势而上"},{"level":2,"text":"胞吞与胞吐：大宗物流","id":"胞吞与胞吐-大宗物流"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"细胞学说与细胞类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/cell-fundamentals/cell-theory-and-types"},"next":{"title":"细胞器与内膜系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/cell-biology/cell-fundamentals/organelles-endomembrane-system"}}